# ── Optional: Firebase Cloud Messaging (push notifications) ─────────────────
# Generate at Firebase console → Project settings → Service accounts → Generate new private key
# On Vercel (no filesystem to read from): paste the ENTIRE JSON contents as one line into
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON below. For local/server runs with a file on disk, use
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_PATH instead (relative to fastapi/backend/).
